Multiplane is installed separately from npm and retains its Apache-2.0 license.
Local modification: video-pv-cli applies a SHA-256 guarded WebGPU queue barrier
to Multiplane 0.3.10 src/capture.mjs before rendering. Its original package,
copyright and licenses remain installed. Bridge ID and source hash are recorded
in every render report. The bridge is implemented in webgpu_bridge.go.
FFmpeg is installed separately; preserve the selected build's licensing terms.
Third-party shader libraries described in the references are optional and are
not redistributed as part of the original WGSL helper.

